WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,900
my power is disappearing

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,450
No, not disappear

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,650
It was removed

4
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:16,060
All the power of ghost clothes has been sealed

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,100
my power is back

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,060
That moment just now

7
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,260
I'm like an ordinary ghost

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,740
No, weaker than normal

9
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:36,560
How could a human be you?

10
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,480
Starting today we will change dormitories

11
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,000
You can complete the procedures yourself tomorrow

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,480
I'll have a meal in the cafeteria

13
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:43,360
Why did my sister's doctor refuse to throw her here?

14
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,040
Who will tell me what happened

15
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:50,340
Have you been bullied?

16
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,540
Are you in this dormitory too?

17
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,100
Hmm, does that cool guy like to bully others?

18
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,060
Is his phase normal?
